of the travel pass information is correct. ","#","^Layout:Right","/#","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"choice_7":["^White is my given name, and Brandt is my family name. You've reversed the order—how strange! ","#","^Layout:Left","/#","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"choice_8":["^Of course, I'm a man! Isn't my beard thick enough? ","#","^Layout:Left","/#","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"choice_9":["^That part was filled in by the guy in the white hat. You should ask him. We don't record dates like that! ","#","^Layout:Left","/#","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"choice_10":["^You people sure love to set deadlines, as if my life and death could be decided by ink on a piece of paper! ","#","^Layout:Left","/#","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"choice_11":["^This is none of your business. Do you understand? ","#","^Layout:Left","/#","\n","end","end",{"#f":1}],"global decl":["ev",0,{"VAR=":"choice"},"/ev","end",null],"#f":1}],"listDefs":{}}